IMPORT prelude

-- Provision index of the Legislation Interpretation Act 2021 (South Australia), version 20.11.2025 (unofficial plain-text rendering).
-- Generated by a script that reads the text file: one entry per Part, section, subsection, paragraph, sub-paragraph,
-- Schedule, Schedule Part and Schedule clause, with its identifier and the heading of its section, Part or clause as printed.
-- Identifiers carry the kind of unit, because the text prints some numbers twice
-- (a Part 7 of the Act and a Part 7 of Schedule 1; sections 24 and 25 and clauses 24 and 25 of Schedule 1).
-- A subsection, paragraph or sub-paragraph has no heading of its own; its entry carries the heading of its section or clause.
-- "line in the text file" is the line of the deposited text file on which the provision starts.

DECLARE `Kind of provision` IS ONE OF
    KindPart, KindSection, KindSubsection, KindParagraph, KindSubparagraph, KindSchedule, KindSchedulePart, KindClause

DECLARE Provision HAS
    kind                    IS A `Kind of provision`
    identifier              IS A STRING
    heading                 IS A STRING
    `line in the text file` IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A LIST OF Provision
`the provisions of the Act` MEANS
