GIVEN `the identifier` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE Provision
`the provision the index gives for` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (`has this identifier`) `the provisions of the Act`
        WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
        WHEN `the first` FOLLOWED BY `the rest` THEN JUST `the first`
    WHERE
        `has this identifier` provision MEANS provision's identifier EQUALS `the identifier`

GIVEN `the identifier` IS A STRING, `the heading` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the index gives this heading for` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision the index gives for` `the identifier`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST `the entry` THEN `the entry`'s heading EQUALS `the heading`

GIVEN `the kind` IS A `Kind of provision`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of provisions of a kind` MEANS
    count (filter (`is of this kind`) `the provisions of the Act`)
    WHERE
        `is of this kind` provision MEANS provision's kind EQUALS `the kind`

§ `Tests`

-- The Contents lists Parts 1 to 10 of the Act, 60 sections in Parts 1 to 10, Schedule 1 with its Part 7, and clauses 24 and 25.
#ASSERT `the number of provisions of a kind` KindPart EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the number of provisions of a kind` KindSection EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `the number of provisions of a kind` KindSchedule EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the number of provisions of a kind` KindSchedulePart EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the number of provisions of a kind` KindClause EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "section 3" "Application of Act"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "section 46" "Part-day public holidays and periods of time"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "section 19A" "Amending Act or instrument to be construed as part of amended Act or instrument"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "Part 7" "Time, distance, age and amounts"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "Schedule 1 Part 7" "Transitional provisions"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "clause 24 of Schedule 1" "Bills introduced before commencement of section 19"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "section 44(1)" "Calculating time"
#ASSERT `the index gives this heading for` "section 32(2)(f)" "Effect of repeal, amendment or expiry"
#ASSERT `the provision the index gives for` "section 2" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the provision the index gives for` "section 61" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`the index gives this heading for` "section 46" "Calculating time")
